    1) Maximize the minimum radius lambda (feasibility monotone in lambda).
    2) With the minimum pinned, add remaining slack to the largest circles
       to maximize the total sum. Always feasible, never negative."""
    centers = np.asarray(centers, float)
    n = centers.shape[0]
    border = np.minimum(np.minimum(centers[:, 0], 1 - centers[:, 0]),
                        np.minimum(centers[:, 1], 1 - centers[:, 1]))
